{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "455b6187-b797-86bf-ad4c-8fc84fe4bc34",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:40:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. My name is Bridget Gallagher. I call about the snow, the plow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mrs. Gallagher. Okay, what's going on with the plow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My car is in the street, in front of my house. The city plow come and push the snow, and now my car is closed in. Snow is high all around the car. Hard, heavy snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so the plow went by and left a bank of snow against your car. And what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, a bank. The address is sixty-one Dixon Street. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-one Dixon Street. Got it. Is that the storm from the weekend, the one Sunday into Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The storm Sunday, the snow and then the rain. Monday it stop. Now the snow is wet and very heavy, then it freeze. I cannot move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that snow turns to concrete once it freezes. Hold on one second, I'm writing this down. [pause] Okay. Sorry, I hear water running. Am I interrupting you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I wash the dishes. The water is running, sorry. I can turn it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:38:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine, don't worry about it. So the car is blocked in by the plow bank at sixty-one Dixon. Is the car parked on the street or in a driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the street. In front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, on the street. Is there something else you need, besides the snow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please, I want sand. For the ground. In front of my house is ice, very slippery. I am afraid, no, I only need sand to put. Can the city bring sand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have it. You'd like sand for the sidewalk and the front of your house at sixty-one Dixon Street. I can put in a request for that. I can't give you a time, the crews are still working through a lot of calls from the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sand. For the front of my house. Thank you. And the car? Somebody can come dig?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow crews don't usually dig out individual cars, but I'll note that your car was plowed in so they know. If you can clear a little yourself, or a neighbor can help, that would get you moving sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. Please say again. The crew do not dig the car, but you write it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I'm writing down the plowed-in car and the request for sand. Both at sixty-one Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Good. Do you need my phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, in case the crew has a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is four-zero-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Your request is in, Mrs. Gallagher. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and watch your step on that ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
